e_name": "05_Faces_Selector_2560x1440.png", "id": "1288337783335827", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831299_1288337786669160_4475558771986816353_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m_CEjQahwdoQ7kNvwFfFZrn&_nc_oc=AdpLv7Dm_lSvWivtKghSwsl95YpUx3KrVqH_eOZbAMgR55Kl94KzV-MwcVP3U7Wz5ec&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP9ARiXBAsZamohy5Jh7MehWoU0942HQX6v_NeXKRMYrQ&oe=6AD0D0AD"}, {"file_name": "01_Barker_Neutral_2560x1440.png", "id": "1821110108888468", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830441_1821110112221801_8561623093088699699_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=T910tPTzFwsQ7kNvwFz-oAj&_nc_oc=Adrl5Z62EEPj0Bhigfz3EK2-cECUKZWCww-8XUWCapYmRaDjP3pn6VbbpnN82A85omo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOUZMfqdTOtGYNkm64cdmt6uy5fv7tUy7bM8gW3YQ0cQg&oe=6AD0FF4F"}, {"file_name": "03_Barker_Action_2560x1440.png", "id": "2620587385039026", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/585799753_2620587388372359_8557321908904764527_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QxNfn9Lb-OcQ7kNvwFditDL&_nc_oc=AdpG3ftVk6zJKzdZHM9MxjV0ACNgkmuOrD4w5-0vC2XOJlBdnehEZgEFlFpoikz2zO4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOB5nlmj3FyvhS5sHaRu8333iKLPMipBnKDoc1r4kQV6w&oe=6AD102FC"}, {"file_name": "02_Flexer_Neutral_2560x1440.png", "id": "3167831576755462", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831299_3167831580088795_7645227145100028470_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DAPOlbzroZkQ7kNvwEBx2fP&_nc_oc=AdpqsCZRJiMZCnf0bksKnisJSSthoWYoTr7Ftz4NnH5yhhyV9dB_5iG7k1NoO6gV5fY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNMZL2weAXwwpV4t3mzThwboIvnBJ2aBgLR_2ZFOysgIg&oe=6AD0D4CC"}, {"file_name": "04_Flexer_Action_2560x1440.png", "id": "2184872072072152", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831299_2184872075405485_4008272742366392584_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lpVrmvRmkCUQ7kNvwFg_rik&_nc_oc=Adqls6ofw2QvFFWq5RZjVcemb212yr1gWQsZxVE-353QhnPqfpUz5wT7V2ps-qJOhCw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOOsFlBLp-i1k2gKgQaiTcoy-oerK-JxMp1s5V28q2rQg&oe=6AD0FE13"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Punchable Face", "keywords": ["boxing", "punching", "arcade", "stress", "fitness"], "long_description": "Sometimes you just want to punch a face.\n\n**Punchable Face** is a simple VR stress toy built around one idea: choose an irritating character, step into their world, and go to town.\n\n## Choose Your Face\n\n### The Barker\nA grinning carnival loudmouth waiting for you under the lights.\n\n### The Flexer\nA smug car-meet regular surrounded by modified cars and nighttime parking-lot lights.\n\n## Hit Harder\n\nEvery valid punch is measured using your controller speed and converted into an **Impact Score from 100 to 999**.\n\nChase your Session Best and watch each character react with movement, haptics, impact audio, facial reactions, and accumulating redness that slowly fades when you stop.\n\n## Features\n\n- Two characters with unique environments\n- Physics-based punch detection\n- Impact Score and Session Best\n- Hand-specific haptics\n- Reactive faces and visual feedback\n- Standing or seated play\n- No locomotion, rounds, health bars, or complicated progression\n\n**Pick a face. Punch it.**", "short_description": "Pick an annoying face, put on your gloves, and start swinging. Punchable Face is a simple VR stress toy with satisfying impacts, haptics, scoring, and two ridiculous characters to pummel."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.stormxr.tech/privacy-policy/punchable-face", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "StormXR LLC", "support_website_url": "https://www.stormxr.tech/contact", "website_url": "https://www.stormxr.tech/development", "category": n